WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.200
What does adoption add to forgiveness?

2
00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:08.020
Forgiveness answers our guilt.

3
00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:10.820
Adoption tells us where we belong.

4
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:12.400
In Romans eight,

5
00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:15.200
Paul says believers have received the Spirit

6
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:16.100
of adoption.

7
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:17.860
By him we cry,

8
00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:18.700
Abba,

9
00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:19.220
Father.

10
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.240
The Spirit bears witness with our spirit

11
00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:24.020
that we are children of God.

12
00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:27.020
Those in Christ belong to God’s family.

13
00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:29.880
Paul also calls them heirs with Christ.

14
00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.280
That includes suffering with him on the

15
00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:32.940
way to glory.

16
00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:35.960
Belonging does not mean an easy life.

17
00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:37.740
As you read this passage,

18
00:00:38.260 --> 00:00:39.420
notice the family words:

19
00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:40.300
Father,

20
00:00:40.980 --> 00:00:41.320
children,

21
00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:42.140
heirs.

22
00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:44.500
Let them shape how you think about

23
00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:45.780
your relationship with God.

24
00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:48.280
You are welcomed as his child.
